+/* The artifact's preference scope. Two artifacts share one core, and they must
+ * not share the settings that carry their identity: a player who turns the
+ * mastering off in the remaster keeps the authentic raw, and the other way
+ * around. The settings that are the player's environment - bindings, device,
+ * volume - stay shared, because configuring the gamepad twice is a tax, not a
+ * feature. */
+static std::string g_preference_scope;
